    "body": "## Summary\n- only merge projected sound embeddings when the batch carries authenticated audio inputs\n- preserve generated occurrences of the sound-token vocabulary ID as ordinary text in image-only/text-only batches\n- add a regression test for an image-only input containing that ordinary token ID\n\n## Validation\n- targeted Nemotron Omni regression test passed\n- validated in a 4-node NeMo RL OSWorld smoke through rollout, old-policy logprobs, optimizer/refit, and `step_1` checkpoint\n\nSigned-off-by: Linglin Jing <linglinj@cw-dfw-cs-001-vscode-01.cm.cluster>",
